{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Quant System v3","text":"<p>Moteur Quantitatif Modulaire</p> <p>Quant System v3 est un moteur quantitatif modulaire con\u00e7u pour l\u2019analyse de march\u00e9, la g\u00e9n\u00e9ration de signaux, la construction de strat\u00e9gies, le backtesting et l\u2019int\u00e9gration future de mod\u00e8les d\u2019apprentissage automatique.</p> <p>Cette version introduit un pipeline enti\u00e8rement structur\u00e9, une architecture claire et une documentation professionnelle.</p>"},{"location":"#fonctionnalites-principales","title":"\ud83d\ude80 Fonctionnalit\u00e9s principales","text":"<ul> <li>Pipeline v3 compos\u00e9 de 12 stages ind\u00e9pendants  </li> <li>Backtest event\u2011driven  </li> <li>Multi\u2011UT int\u00e9gr\u00e9  </li> <li>Indicateurs techniques avanc\u00e9s  </li> <li>G\u00e9n\u00e9ration de signaux quantitatifs  </li> <li>Construction de signaux composites  </li> <li>Gestion du risque  </li> <li>Export structur\u00e9 des r\u00e9sultats  </li> <li>Support ML (features + mod\u00e8les)  </li> <li>Documentation MkDocs Material</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#execution-rapide","title":"\u25b6\ufe0f Ex\u00e9cution rapide","text":""},{"location":"#installation","title":"Installation","text":"<p>```bash pip install -r requirements.txt</p>"},{"location":"architecture/overview/","title":"overview.md","text":"<p>```markdown</p>"},{"location":"architecture/overview/#architecture-vue-densemble","title":"Architecture \u2014 Vue d\u2019ensemble","text":"<p>Cette page pr\u00e9sente la structure g\u00e9n\u00e9rale du syst\u00e8me Quant System v3.</p>"},{"location":"architecture/overview/#objectifs","title":"Objectifs","text":"<ul> <li>D\u00e9crire les composants principaux</li> <li>Montrer les interactions entre modules</li> <li>Donner une vision claire du fonctionnement global</li> </ul>"},{"location":"architecture/overview/#structure-generale","title":"Structure g\u00e9n\u00e9rale","text":"<p>Le syst\u00e8me est organis\u00e9 autour d\u2019un pipeline modulaire compos\u00e9 de 12 stages ind\u00e9pendants.</p>"},{"location":"architecture/overview/#composants-principaux","title":"Composants principaux","text":"<ul> <li>Pipeline v3</li> <li>Modules quantitatifs</li> <li>Backtest event-driven</li> <li>Export structur\u00e9</li> <li>Int\u00e9gration ML</li> </ul>"},{"location":"architecture/overview/#a-completer","title":"\u00c0 compl\u00e9ter","text":"<ul> <li>Diagrammes</li> <li>D\u00e9tails des d\u00e9pendances</li> <li>Flux de donn\u00e9es</li> </ul>"},{"location":"architecture/pipeline_v3/","title":"Pipeline v3 \u2014 Description compl\u00e8te","text":"<p>Le pipeline v3 est compos\u00e9 de 12 stages ex\u00e9cut\u00e9s s\u00e9quentiellement.</p>"},{"location":"architecture/pipeline_v3/#objectifs","title":"Objectifs","text":"<ul> <li>Nettoyer les donn\u00e9es</li> <li>Construire les indicateurs</li> <li>G\u00e9n\u00e9rer les signaux</li> <li>Ex\u00e9cuter la strat\u00e9gie</li> <li>Calculer les m\u00e9triques</li> <li>Exporter les r\u00e9sultats</li> </ul>"},{"location":"architecture/pipeline_v3/#stages","title":"Stages","text":"<ol> <li>data  </li> <li>preprocess  </li> <li>multi_ut  </li> <li>indicators  </li> <li>quant  </li> <li>composite  </li> <li>strategy  </li> <li>risk  </li> <li>backtest  </li> <li>export  </li> </ol>"},{"location":"architecture/pipeline_v3/#exemple-dexecution","title":"Exemple d\u2019ex\u00e9cution","text":"<pre><code>python main_pipeline_v3.py\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"architecture/pipeline_v3/#a-completer","title":"\u00c0 compl\u00e9ter","text":"<ul> <li>Param\u00e8tres de chaque stage</li> <li>Flux d\u00e9taill\u00e9</li> <li>Diagrammes</li> </ul>"},{"location":"architecture/projet_structure/","title":"Projet_structure.md","text":"<p>```markdown</p>"},{"location":"architecture/projet_structure/#structure-du-pro